# Sentinel - Launch Plan

> A step-by-step roadmap from "working app on my machine" to "installable on real phones and live on Google Play."

You already have a working app, a live website, and docs. What's missing is **hosted infrastructure**, **installable builds**, and **store compliance**. This document walks through it phase by phase, in order.

