## Phase 0 - Decide what "v1 launch" means

*Time: 30 minutes*

Pick one primary goal for the first release:

| Goal | What you ship | Timeline |
|------|---------------|----------|
| **A. Friends & testers** | APK link + relay | 2-5 days |
| **B. Public web demo** | Web app + relay | 1-3 days |
| **C. Google Play (internal)** | `.aab` + Play Console internal track | 1-3 weeks |
| **D. Google Play (public)** | Full store listing + review | 3-6 weeks |

**Recommendation:** do **A first**, then **C**, then **D**. Web (B) can run in parallel.

