## Phase 1 - Put the project in one place

*Day 1*

**Why:** you need a single repo others (and you) can trust.

1. Install tools (one-time on your Mac):
```bash
   xcode-select --install
   gh auth login
```
2. Push everything to GitHub:
```bash
   cd /Users/jongurakuqi/Projects/bitchat-vibe
   gh repo create sentinel --public --source=. --remote=origin --push
```
3. Update website GitHub links in `website/index.html`, then redeploy:
```bash
   cd website && vercel deploy --prod --yes
```

**Done when:** code is on GitHub, website points to the real repo.

