## Phase 7 - App Store compliance gaps

*Before public Production*

These aren't blockers for a private APK, but Google **will** want them for a public listing:

| Requirement | Status today | Action |
|-------------|--------------|--------|
| Privacy policy | Missing | Add `/privacy` on website |
| Account deletion | Missing | Add "Delete account" in Profile or document process |
| Push notifications | Missing | OK for v1; users must open app to see messages |
| Block / report | Missing | Needed for public social apps; plan for v1.1 |

